1
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:18,351
-For Sarah?
-[man] Sarah?

2
00:00:18,435 --> 00:00:19,269
Yeah.

3
00:00:20,395 --> 00:00:23,606
["Seasons (Waiting On You)" 
by Future Islands playing]

4
